2. Zoom out
The phase covers what the app needs on 2026-11-06: image.file on all 18 pictures, true approvals, the hand-off folder with all 16 media paths w01.json names (book audio, song audio, song videos, posters, line pictures, phoneme audio). Missing from the plan text: the workbooks-commit MANIFEST line and the byte-for-byte rule (F3), and the correct root path for the hand-off copies (F2).

3. Zero-decision points and defaults
- v1/v2 source resolution (BLOCKER, F1): pictures.json names v1 files for a-net, a-nose, nan-can-nod; only the approved v2 files exist; the list is pinned by print tests. Default: resolve by row id, take the unique color file with the highest version; exit 1 on zero or multiple candidates; provenance records the resolved name.
- Test file list for RED/GREEN_TEST_COMMAND: add storytime-print-contract.test.ts (F4).
- Hand-off copy root: content/storytime/, paths exactly as w01.json names them (F2).
- MANIFEST.txt: add "workbooks-commit: <full sha>" and the byte-for-byte git show equality rule (F3).
- approval.words format: one string, quotes in time order with times (F5).
- 400 KB fallback: re-encode only the offending file, quality down to 75, record it (F6).
- sharp settings: defaults, record the sharp version (F7).
- Caption rule, path rule, check status, provenance format: fully pinned; no decision open.

